<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran has barred two Iraqi aircraft and temporarily halted civilian flights over its airspace. Iraq saw over 10,000 citizens apply for gun registration in a single week, indicating rising internal tension. The United States is attempting to evacuate its personnel from facilities under fire in Iraq. Regional actors condemned the Houthi‑alleged attack on Riyadh’s King Khalid International Airport that killed 12 people and injured 309. The conflict recorded 396 battle‑related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Qatar news agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQdHp0UDV4b2xOeERjVnB0Vm5PQjBUTEtKODVFYXpfeklld1FDc1hDaVdXNHlUcE5Xa3BPdHlDOUJKaFBJUmpjVEpneUpQOU82RGhMeVpFbnNlQlZMNDFHYmxoRVFFdTBTeXBESnZXckYyYi11NTlhOHVadWFpeTFFSE5hdHNSSW5MR0RWU010c0Y2NVRZRS1lTE5IWU9mZ1o0YzJiX0FR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE5CMDRUbWprdTZuQU5GWEVyclRMRWdYdjJWT1drcXl3cktyMmtjNlpMdkNNT2M0QkV3cTRBOWRUVG1RN0lDRHJ0NHBvajJac1YzZkNVTU1YNlhRM1lmZ3pDSV9KMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOWkdaY0VVdGtma1JFLU1vdXI5M1M3SEVaRUkwRzliU2Nfc01hQjdRdGhLNUdVUW5ObThWb2RuTndScnFIM1NmSC03dkZjQnFpVnl6ZTBURmRYWTlCUVRsZDhsQ0NET1JJTnN5Z3VzbnBIVHcwcEJTal9mbTBDbTc2NXc3TGZkX1lyeWwtdnpSamw0aW5VYTRrUDRhWmhVaW0tY3dIUkJZTWd1WEtSVkdr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Eye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFA1anVXUUJlbmRrWm9hRjBPbkhXMzkyemQwdjRELVF1VndGYlRSSEctXzRhRk5lOTk1RGlPVGx2MVgwTXF6aWwtMWZUUGVnVzRkN0lXX1VXcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangladesh Sangbad Sangstha (BSS)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNbTVmQ1dCMDEteW8xdmo3QXh1WXEyaF9wZVZPS3l5dFliUXU3SE85V1VPbk